{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965930/extras/9ee35cba75c4c38d276c50808f46496a.webp?t=1760086544\" width=1560 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: evaluate the mining potential of uninhabited alien planets. Straightforward enough until you uncover vast underground ruins packed with strange devices, energy cores, and structures. Then you find Trent\u2019s \u201cessential\u201d piece of equipment: a cricket bat. Turns out, it comes in handy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965930/extras/0bf780a95276545ef78feb8073cad763.webp?t=1760086544\" width=1560 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Parasite</strong> is a physics\u2011driven puzzle adventure set on an alien planet. It offers several ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Campaign:</strong>\u00a0Play as an Operative exploring mysterious ruins while your two crew mates chat and banter from orbit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co\u2011Op Mode:</strong> Team up with a friend to tackle the single player campaign, perfect for players who enjoy solving challenges together at their own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co\u2011Op Campaign: </strong>Special levels designed only for two players, where coordination and timing are just as important as brainpower.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965930/extras/dcb2f251f8091cba7025ced101cb8512.webp?t=1760086544\" width=1560 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay revolves around manipulating energy cores, light constructs and gravity devices to navigate through alien puzzles. As you progress, levels introduce new mechanics and deepen the mystery. Each new challenge builds on what you\u2019ve learned, gradually revealing that these structures are not there just to test you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965930/extras/bfd15a9d266337debc90e03aee740ed5.webp?t=1760086544\" width=1560 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper, you\u2019ll uncover why the ruins were built, what they\u2019re hiding, and what happened to those who came before. And with Trent\u2019s cricket bat in the mix, you\u2019ll never forget how you got there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965930/extras/e725047614bc2a3d4dc94c9ff8d67a6a.webp?t=1760086544\" width=1560 height=49 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single-player campaign</strong> with the main story, also playable in co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dedicated co-op levels </strong>requiring two players to work together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics\u2011based puzzles </strong>that use gravity manipulation, light\u2011bridge devices and core\u2011merging to overcome intricate environmental challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A planet </strong>filled with enormous underground structures, each designed to test you in different ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles that progress </strong>as you progress, with levels continuously introducing new mechanics and adding new challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story and a mystery</strong> that you uncover in\u00a0this alien place, while your crew Trent and Delilah follow 